If any prop/name differs from the stub code, adjust the stubs to match reality (report what you changed).

### Step 5: Typecheck

Run: `cd apps/mobile && bun run typecheck`
Expected: zero errors. (The `seasons` tab route doesn't exist yet — the NativeTabs.Trigger `name="seasons"` is just a string, so it should not error. Confirm.)

